    {
      "block_id": 22,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "The supervisor programmer's model consists of supplementary registers used in the \nsupervisor mode. The M68000 MPUs contain identical supervisor mode register \nresources, which are shown in Figure 2-2, including the status register (high-order byte) \nand the supervisor stack pointer (SSP/A7'). \n",
      "bbox": [
