    {
      "block_id": 27,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "In addition to the supervisor stack pointer and status register, it includes the vector base \nregister (VRB) and the alternate function code registers (AFC).The VBR is used to \ndetermine the location of the exception vector table in memory to support multiple vector \n",
